Batman? <fermat111@hotmail.com> wrote:
>Just found a bones pile in Minetown of the unfortunate Winifred the
>wizard. In the pile there was a cursed bad. Since I am short on holy
>water, and it is cursed, how do I check to see if it is a BoH or not?

Loot it. If 1/13 of the items in it disappear, it's a bag of holding.

The normal tactic is to zap the bag with a wand of cancellation, which
will change it into an uncursed bag of holding[1]. You can then get at
the loot.

Using #name on another bag of holding (or on all the other types of bag)
will tell you if this one is a bag of holding or not, but that may not
actually be too useful.

Cheers,

